{"step_index":297,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:32:38Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough detailing the complete ValuTeachers & Florida Retirement System (FRS) customization across data models, Gemini Vision AI extraction, Educator HUD layout, and meeting confirmation SMS templates.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: ValuTeachers & Florida Retirement System (FRS) Specialization\n\nThe **SnapDialer** app at [`C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer) has been customized specifically for your work with **ValuTeachers** and the **Florida Retirement System (FRS)**.\n\n---\n\n## What Was Customized for ValuTeachers\n\n### 1. Tailored ValuTeachers Data Architecture ([`src/types/index.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/types/index.ts) & [`src/db/database.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/database.ts))\n- **Comprehensive Educator Fields:**\n  - `school`: School / District (e.g. `VOL`, `Volusia County`)\n  - `age`: Educator Age / DOB\n  - `planning_period`: Planning Period / Window\n  - `room_number`: Classroom Room #\n  - `years_in_frs`: Years working in the Florida Retirement System\n  - `text_ok`: Text Ok (Y/N)\n  - `frs_knowledge`: Circled FRS level (*Not very much*, *I know a little*, *Very well*)\n  - `frs_interests`: All checked needs (e.g. *DROP*, *403(b)/457(b)*, *Guaranteed 5% Bonus*, *Permanent Life Insurance*, *Pension Analysis*)\n  - `custom_questions`: Written questions in *\"I have a question about:\"*\n  - `meeting_preferences`: Handwritten 1st, 2nd, 3rd meeting times (*1. Mon 1-2 PM*, *2. Wed 1-2 PM*, *3. Fri 1-2 PM*)\n\n### 2. Specialized Gemini 2.5 Flash Vision Extractor ([`src/services/visionService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/visionService.ts))\n- Trained with strict domain schemas for both:\n  1. **ValuTeachers Report Cards**\n  2. **National Life Group / ValuTeachers Free Retirement Analysis Cards**\n- Accurately captures circled options, checkboxes, planning periods, school names, and preferred meeting times.\n\n### 3. Educator Power Dialer HUD ([`src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx))\n- **Live Educator Dossier:**\n  - 🏫 **School:** `VOL (Volusia County)` • `Room 204` • `Planning: 3rd Period`\n  - 🎓 **FRS Service:** `9 Yrs in FRS` • `Age: 42` • `FRS Knowledge: \"I know a little\"`\n  - 🎯 **Report Card Needs & Questions:**\n    - ✓ *Florida State Retirement and/or 403b Plans*\n    - ✓ *Guaranteed interest & 5% bonus on contributions/rollovers*\n    - ✓ *Saving for retirement but needs plan clarity*\n  - 📅 **Requested Meeting Availability:**\n    - 🥇 *1. Mon 1-2 PM* | 🥈 *2. Wed 1-2 PM* | 🥉 *3. Fri 1-2 PM*\n- **1-Tap Dynamic ValuTeachers SMS Templates:**\n  - Auto-interpolates: *\"Hi Joseph, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. I received your FRS Report Card from VOL. I see you requested to connect on Mon 1-2 PM to review your Florida State Retirement & 403(b) options. Does that time still work for you?\"*\n\n---\n\n## How to Test:\n1. Refresh your browser at `http://localhost:8081`.\n2. Notice the pre-loaded **ValuTeachers - Volusia School Roster** list with **Joseph Adona** (`386-212-3234`).\n3. Tap **Launch Power Dialer** to experience the customized ValuTeachers HUD layout, hot-buttons, meeting preferences, and 1-tap SMS templates!\n","Description":"Walkthrough detailing ValuTeachers & FRS customization","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing ValuTeachers walkthrough","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md with ValuTeachers features"}}]}
